  "description": "CKEditor field type for Dignite.Abp.FlexFields - lets a flex field be edited with CKEditor 5 (https://ckeditor.com), persisted as HTML or, per field via ContentFormat, GitHub Flavored Markdown. A bolt-on, not a built-in: referencing this package pulls in only Dignite.Abp.FlexFields.Abstractions - the Angular half (@dignite/ng.flex-fields-ckeditor) is what actually loads the CKEditor 5 UI, so a host wires both together, but neither module references the other.",
